03:34.197 --> 03:35.802
Well this we already solved before.

03:35.802 --> 03:39.662
This is the same thing
as e to the t, right?

03:39.662 --> 03:41.821
If we raise something to the 0.5 t,

03:41.821 --> 03:43.156
