04:04.815 --> 04:05.891
Did I do that right?

04:05.891 --> 04:07.518
This closes around the x squared,

04:07.518 --> 04:10.870
that closes with that,
yep ok that looks right.

04:10.870 --> 04:13.369
And then my variable of integration is x,

04:13.369 --> 04:17.960
